        "original_id": "f6d16961-4e8b-50f9-9deb-2e89b993e041",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Winning Team\n- People: Grover Cleveland Alexander, Ronald Reagan, Doris Day, Aimee Alexander, Frank Lovejoy, Rogers Hornsby\n- Topics: Major League Baseball\n\nFacts:\n- Grover Cleveland Alexander lived from 1887 to 1950 and was a major league pitcher.\n- Rogers Hornsby, Sr. lived from April 27, 1896 to January 5, 1963.\n- Rogers Hornsby, Sr. was nicknamed \"The Rajah\" and was an American baseball infielder, manager, and coach who played 23 seasons in Major League Baseball.\n- The Winning Team is a fictionalized biography about the life of Grover Cleveland Alexander.\n- Ronald Reagan starred in The Winning Team as Grover Cleveland Alexander.\n- Doris Day starred in The Winning Team as Alexander's wife, Aimee.\n- Frank Lovejoy starred in The Winning Team as baseball star Rogers Hornsby.",
